# Environment for the codebuddy2api gateway (systemd --user).
# Copy to ~/.config/codebuddy2api.env and adjust if needed.
#
# The gateway must reach https://www.codebuddy.ai. If your machine resolves that
# host through a proxy or a fake-IP DNS range, you MUST set an outbound proxy
# here — otherwise the gateway hangs on connect. If you have direct
# connectivity, leave these commented out.
#
# HTTP_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:<port>
# HTTPS_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:<port>
# NO_PROXY=localhost,127.0.0.1,::1
